# Source maps — 3.8 MB of debug-only data, not needed by end users
*.map

# Orphaned FontAwesome 4 webfonts. Nothing references these — the plugin ships
# font-awesome5.css, which only points at fa-solid / fa-regular / fa-brands.
assets/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.*
assets/fonts/FontAwesome.otf

# Dead webfont formats for the FA5 faces. Both sit last in the @font-face
# `src:` list, so no browser that supports woff2/woff/ttf ever requests them.
#   .svg — dropped by Chrome 38 (2014), never in Firefox/IE/Edge
#   .eot — Internet Explorer only; IE reached end of life in June 2022
# NOTE: fontIconPicker.* is deliberately NOT listed here. That face ships no
# woff2, so its .svg and .ttf are its only fallbacks and must stay.
assets/fonts/fa-solid-900.svg
assets/fonts/fa-regular-400.svg
assets/fonts/fa-brands-400.svg
assets/fonts/fa-solid-900.eot
assets/fonts/fa-regular-400.eot
assets/fonts/fa-brands-400.eot

# Internal docs & archives
README.md
compatibility-report.md
*.sql
*.tar.gz
*.zip
